{"id":"st2088","designation":"ST 2088","title":"Essence Element Key Register Structure","state":"stabilized","suite":null,"official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2088/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2088/","checked_at":"2026-11-18"},"scope":"This standard defines the structure of a register of essence element keys as used by essence container specifications coded according to SMPTE ST 336, e.g. SMPTE ST 379-1 and ST 379-2 and related Essence Mapping Documents. The standard normatively defines universal identifiers, essence element names, definitions, and standardized symbols, as well as other normative and informative fields. The associated essence element key register includes all entries which have been approved according to the specific procedures defined in SMPTE AG 18.","outline":[{"level":1,"title":"1 Scope","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"2 Conformance Notation","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"3 Normative References","page":3},{"level":1,"title":"4 Terms and Definitions","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.1 Attribute","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.2 Class","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.3 Context","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.4 Designator","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.5 Identifier","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.6 Item","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.7 Item designator","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.8 Essence element key register","page":4},{"level":2,"title":"4.9 Leaf","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.10 Level number","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.11 Essence element","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.12 Node","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.13 Registry","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.14 Register","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.15 Registration authority","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.16 Top-level node","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.17 Universal label","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.18 UL designator","page":5},{"level":2,"title":"4.19 Value","page":5},{"level":1,"title":"5 SMPTE Essence Element Key structure","page":6},{